# Implementation Plan: Improved Manual Payment & Smart Shipping

This plan outlines the enhancements to the **Coolex Shop** checkout process, focusing on more reliable manual payment verification and a fairer shipping fee structure.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> This change introduces a **Reference Number** requirement for manual GCash payments and a **Shipping Region** selector. This will slightly change the checkout flow but will significantly reduce manual verification errors.

## Proposed Changes

### [Database & Models]

#### [MODIFY] [Order_model.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/models/Order_model.php)
- Update `create_order` to accept and store `shipping_region` and `shipping_fee`.
- Ensure the `orders` table has the necessary columns: `payment_ref_no`, `shipping_region`, and `shipping_fee`.

### [Checkout Engine]

### [Checkout Engine]

#### [MODIFY] [Checkout.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/controllers/Checkout.php)
- **Place Order**: Keep the current flat-rate shipping (no changes to shipping logic as requested).
- **Confirm Payment**: Update the `confirm_payment` method to capture the `payment_ref_no` from the form and store it in the database.

