  - Use `.glass-card` for the main containers.
  - Implement the "Steps Guide" with numbered red circles.
  - Add specific instructions for finding the Reference Number in the GCash app.

#### [MODIFY] [checkout/payment.php](file:///f:/UniServerZ/www/coolex_shop/application/views/checkout/payment.php)
